WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:02.100
Justine - Hey guys, it's Justine, and guess what?

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.980
We're back with another unboxing!

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:07.100
Today, we're unboxing the
brand new MacBook Air.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.840
This is the gold version

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:10.247
and if you're new here,

00:00:10.247 --> 00:00:13.710
I'm a huge fan of all of the gold things

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:14.780
that Apple has now.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.690
God, it just matches so perfectly!

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:19.420
One of the main highlights
of the new MacBook Air,

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:21.110
is that it now has a retina display.

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:22.320
It also has touch ID,

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:23.710
an all new butterfly keyboard,

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:25.830
and force touch on the track pad.

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:27.680
You can spec this out to 16 G of ram

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:30.100
and a 1.5 TB solid state drive.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.693
It has 25% louder speakers,

00:00:31.693 --> 00:00:34.249
it weighs just 2.75 pounds.

00:00:34.249 --> 00:00:35.590
That's about a quarter pound--

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:40.590
whoa, lighter than the previous Air.

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:43.379
It's so light that it just
almost took flight. (laughs)

00:00:43.379 --> 00:00:46.538
I actually was at Mac
World when they announced

00:00:46.538 --> 00:00:48.810
the original MacBook Air.

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:51.237
That was in 2008, maybe?

00:00:51.237 --> 00:00:52.870
2007, 2008?

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:55.228
It's crazy how quickly time is flying.

00:00:55.228 --> 00:00:58.311
(light techno music)

